    "updated_at": "2025-08-08T09:19:47Z",
    "body": "I wonder if @dontcallmedom has a hidden setting for https://dontcallmedom.github.io/webidlpedia/ so we can find other problematic specifications.\n\nThis also goes for deleters.\n\nI suppose in theory if you called the method but not the setter it could return something, but that still seems wrong so forbidding it altogether would be best I think.",
