    "updated_at": "2025-08-18T08:18:14Z",
    "body": "no special magic in webidlpedia for this at the moment, but grepping through webref, the only specs that you use setters are CSS Typed OM (which was fixed), HTML and SVG2 (which didn't have that issue); HTML is the only one with deleters (also without that issue).",
